  - m_Id: 410822779527172
    m_Localized: ISMAEL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527173
    m_Localized: FEDERICO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527174
    m_Localized: DAVID
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527175
    m_Localized: "MAR\xCDA"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527176
    m_Localized: MARTA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527177
    m_Localized: CARLOTA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527178
    m_Localized: ALICIA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527179
    m_Localized: ANA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527180
    m_Localized: INMA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527181
    m_Localized: ISABEL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527182
    m_Localized: CARLA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822779527183
    m_Localized: "V\u011B\u0159\xED\u0161 t\u011Bmto v\u011Bcem? To je ostuda."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721472
    m_Localized: "To ned\xE1v\xE1 smysl, \u010Detl jsi to v\u016Fbec?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721473
    m_Localized: "Nepos\xEDlej mi takov\xE9 v\u011Bci."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721474
    m_Localized: "Po\u0161li n\u011Bkdy n\u011Bco, co stoj\xED za p\u0159e\u010Dten\xED,
      proto\u017Ee tohle ned\xE1v\xE1 \u017E\xE1dn\xFD smysl."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721475
    m_Localized: "Tento \u010Dl\xE1nek mi p\u0159ipad\xE1 obzvl\xE1\u0161\u0165 zaj\xEDmav\xFD."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721476
    m_Localized: "D\u011Bkuji moc za sd\xEDlen\xED, na takov\xE9 v\u011Bci je t\u0159eba
      d\xE1vat pozor."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721477
    m_Localized: "Jak zaj\xEDmav\xE9! V\u017Edycky jsi pozorn\xFD k t\u011Bmto v\u011Bcem."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721478
    m_Localized: "D\u011Bkuji, \u017Ee jsi to poslal, v\u016Fbec jsem o tom nev\u011Bd\u011Bl(a)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721479
    m_Localized: "Ahoj! Tato zpr\xE1va by byla reakc\xED na \u010Dl\xE1nek, kter\xFD
      jsi poslal(a)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721480
    m_Localized: "Jsem tv\u016Fj zn\xE1m\xFD."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721481
    m_Localized: "Ve skute\u010Dnosti neexistuji a nem\xE1m nic spole\u010Dn\xE9ho
      s \u017E\xE1dnou osobou se stejn\xFDm jm\xE9nem, kterou zn\xE1\u0161 mimo tuto
      aplikaci."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721482
    m_Localized: "Dobr\xE9 r\xE1no! Jsem dal\u0161\xED z tv\xFDch zn\xE1m\xFDch."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721483
    m_Localized: "Tady ti budeme \u0159\xEDkat, co si mysl\xEDme o \u010Dl\xE1nc\xEDch,
      kter\xE9 n\xE1m pos\xEDl\xE1\u0161."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721484
    m_Localized: "Zat\xEDm se vr\xE1t\xEDme na hlavn\xED str\xE1nku, kde jsi byl(a)
      p\u0159edt\xEDm."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721485
    m_Localized: "Aby ses tam dostal(a), klikni na tla\u010D\xEDtko \u201EZP\u011AT\u201C
      v horn\xED \u010D\xE1sti tohoto chatu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721486
    m_Localized: Zkus to!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
